1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,075
A separate video surfaces online

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,075
shot on a different camera by someone closer to the story

3
00:00:05,938 --> 00:00:08,525
The footage looks amateur -- exported late at night

4
00:00:08,713 --> 00:00:09,863
a warmer color grade

5
00:00:10,075 --> 00:00:12,200
none of the polish of the network documentary

6
00:00:13,062 --> 00:00:14,762
It spreads quietly at first

7
00:00:14,925 --> 00:00:15,600
then faster

8
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,150
as more people find it

